      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is OK to land but needs some further work before it is ready for use.\n\nPlease add comments in AuthenticationBase to document which values are being computed by which steps of the code, using the terminology in the RFC. \n\nhttps://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc9382/\n\nHere are the values defined by the RFC:\n- X\n- Y\n- pA (Alice public value)\n- pB (Bob public value)\n- K (group element)\n- TT (protocol transcript)\n- Ke, KcA, KcB (shared secrets)\n- MAC (confirmation message)\n\nThanks.",
      "revId": "7907dd5f57baf7b2c65d255c5e8f646176dc0b1c",
